@startsalt
{
  MusicFS - Settings and Desktop Lyrics
  {+
    Server connection
    { Mode | ^Managed local^ }
    { Server URL | "http://127.0.0.1:PORT" }
    { Status | Ready / MusicFS / API v1 }
    { [Test connection] | [Open logs] | [Retry] }
    Managed local: start packaged server when needed
    Remote: connect only
  }
  {+
    Music Providers
    {#
      Provider | Account | Sync | Action
      Local Files / NAS | Not required | Ready | [Configure]
      Cloud A | Signed out | Paused | [Sign in]
      Cloud B | Signed in | Cached | [Refresh]
    }
  }
  {+
    Local Files / NAS Provider
    { Allowed roots | "/srv/music; /mnt/nas/music" | [Edit roots] }
    NAS paths must be mounted on the server
    { [X] Watch changes | [Scan now] | [Retry failed scans] }
  }
  {+
    Scraper Plugins
    {#
      Scraper | Enabled | Order | Account | Action
      Scraper A | [X] | 1 | Not required | [Configure]
      Scraper B | [ ] | 2 | Signed out | [Configure]
    }
    Scrapers have independent configuration and credentials
    { [X] Automatic scrape | Output directory | "/srv/musicfs/media" }
    { [ ] Write original audio files | [Configure roots and fields] }
    Lyrics and artwork are stored as separate files by default
  }
  {+
    Manual Scrape
    { Target | ^Track / Album / Batch^ | [Select music] }
    { Fields | ^Lyrics / Artwork / Metadata^ }
    { Scraper | ^Choose scraper^ | Query | "Artist / Title / Album" }
    { [Search] | [Preview and select fields] | [Apply selected] | [Retry failed] }
    { [Edit metadata] | [Import lyrics / artwork] }
    Manual selections are protected from automatic overwrite
  }
  {+
    Appearance
    { Theme | ^System / Light / Dark^ }
    { Skin | ^Default^ }
  }
  {+
    Desktop lyrics
    { [X] Enabled | [X] Always on top | [ ] Click through | [ ] Locked }
    { Font size | "28" | Offset ms | "0" }
    { [Preview] | [Reset position] }
    Example lyric line
    Next lyric line
  }
}
